[{"answer":"One of my favorite places is the library.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/92-the-library-2019-03-29-13-19-13/1.mp3"},{"answer":"I go there to get books for school,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/92-the-library-2019-03-29-13-19-13/2.mp3"},{"answer":"and I go there to get books for pleasure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/92-the-library-2019-03-29-13-19-13/3.mp3"},{"answer":"I often read mysteries for fun.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/92-the-library-2019-03-29-13-19-13/4.mp3"},{"answer":"In the summer, I read lots of mysteries.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/92-the-library-2019-03-29-13-19-13/5.mp3"},{"answer":"I like to sit outside and read.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/92-the-library-2019-03-29-13-19-13/6.mp3"},{"answer":"In the winter, I have to read books for school.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/92-the-library-2019-03-29-13-19-13/7.mp3"},{"answer":"I go to the library to find out things for my projects.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/92-the-library-2019-03-29-13-19-13/8.mp3"},{"answer":"I often use the dictionary and the atlas.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/92-the-library-2019-03-29-13-19-13/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Some of my friends go with me, and we sit at the tables and do our homework.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/92-the-library-2019-03-29-13-19-13/10.mp3"},{"answer":"We can't make a lot of noise in the library. People have to be quiet when they are in a library.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/92-the-library-2019-03-29-13-19-13/11.mp3"},{"answer":"When I first went to the library, I was confused about how to find books.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/92-the-library-2019-03-29-13-19-13/12.mp3"},{"answer":"The librarian showed me how to use the computer to find books.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/92-the-library-2019-03-29-13-19-13/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Now I am able to do all my research myself.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/92-the-library-2019-03-29-13-19-13/14.mp3"},{"answer":"I have read some very interesting books.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/92-the-library-2019-03-29-13-19-13/15.mp3"},{"answer":"I have learned a lot from library books.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/92-the-library-2019-03-29-13-19-13/16.mp3"},{"answer":"I always bring the books back on time so I don't get a fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/92-the-library-2019-03-29-13-19-13/17.mp3"},{"answer":"I am collecting books at home.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/92-the-library-2019-03-29-13-19-13/18.mp3"},{"answer":"People often give me books for gifts.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/92-the-library-2019-03-29-13-19-13/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Soon I will have my own library.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/92-the-library-2019-03-29-13-19-13/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Reading is a good hobby.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/92-the-library-2019-03-29-13-19-13/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Everyone in my family likes to read.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/92-the-library-2019-03-29-13-19-13/22.mp3"},{"answer":"The library has other things besides books.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/92-the-library-2019-03-29-13-19-13/23.mp3"},{"answer":"There are videos at the library.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/92-the-library-2019-03-29-13-19-13/24.mp3"},{"answer":"There are also compact discs at the library.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/92-the-library-2019-03-29-13-19-13/25.mp3"},{"answer":"I have a library card so I can get books,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/92-the-library-2019-03-29-13-19-13/26.mp3"},{"answer":"videos or compact discs whenever I want to.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/92-the-library-2019-03-29-13-19-13/27.mp3"},{"answer":"My mother sometimes goes to the library to look at the magazines.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/92-the-library-2019-03-29-13-19-13/28-2019-06-21-01-16-28.mp3"},{"answer":"She gets some good recipes from the magazines.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/92-the-library-2019-03-29-13-19-13/29.mp3"},{"answer":"My father looks for books on how to build things.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/92-the-library-2019-03-29-13-19-13/30.mp3"},{"answer":"He is building some bookshelves for me at the moment.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/92-the-library-2019-03-29-13-19-13/31.mp3"},{"answer":"He found the instructions in a book.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/92-the-library-2019-03-29-13-19-13/32.mp3"},{"answer":"My little brother reads children's books. He likes books about trains.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/92-the-library-2019-03-29-13-19-13/33.mp3"},{"answer":"I have liked books ever since I was very small.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/92-the-library-2019-03-29-13-19-13/34.mp3"},{"answer":"My mother says that reading is a good habit to get into.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/92-the-library-2019-03-29-13-19-13/35.mp3"}]
